<?xml version="1.0"?><iai friendlyname="Bird or Mammal?" id="00127cec" height="400" width="556" hasaudio="0" hascredits="1" lang="E" basecontroltype="DragDrop" outlinecolorid="1" skinstyle="Standard" skinlib="standard"><slides><slide type="dragdrop" sequence="1" slideid="1"><standardslide><toptext textstyleid="1"><text>&lt;html&gt;¿Sabes cuáles de estos animales son aves y cuáles son mamíferos?&lt;/html&gt;</text></toptext><image>pens.swf</image><bgimage>DDGh_standard_bg.swf</bgimage><imagerefid/><items><item id="0" seq="1" zindex="1" sequence="1"><image inbucketwidth="90" inbucketheight="80" onstagewidth="72" onstageheight="64" popwidth="108" popheight="96" onstagex="24" onstagey="54" baseheight="192" basewidth="216" pctstage="33.4" pctpop="50" pctbucket="41.7">T010712A.JPG</image><hotarea><point><x>14</x><y>20</y></point><point><x>19</x><y>215</y></point><point><x>214</x><y>220</y></point><point><x>264</x><y>11</y></point><point><x>14</x><y>20</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Ardilla voladora</tooltext><solvedtooltext>Las ardillas voladoras, a diferencia de las aves, no pueden realmente volar. Sin embargo, pueden planear desde las ramas altas de los árboles hasta las más bajas.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B822822 </imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="1" seq="1" zindex="2" sequence="2"><image inbucketwidth="90" inbucketheight="80" onstagewidth="73" onstageheight="65" popwidth="100" popheight="89" onstagex="394" onstagey="60" baseheight="192" basewidth="216" pctstage="34.2" pctpop="46.4" pctbucket="41.7">T040701A.JPG</image><hotarea><point><x>314</x><y>12</y></point><point><x>262</x><y>221</y></point><point><x>515</x><y>218</y></point><point><x>517</x><y>16</y></point><point><x>314</x><y>12</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Águila calva</tooltext><solvedtooltext>El águila calva es una de las aves de presa de mayor tamaño. Caza durante el día y algunas veces roba los peces que han capturado otras aves, como el águila pescadora.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B825547</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="2" seq="1" zindex="3" sequence="3"><image inbucketwidth="90" inbucketheight="80" onstagewidth="73" onstageheight="64" popwidth="108" popheight="96" onstagex="402" onstagey="139" baseheight="192" basewidth="216" pctstage="33.8" pctpop="50" pctbucket="41.7">T045515A.JPG</image><hotarea><point><x>301</x><y>7</y></point><point><x>255</x><y>219</y></point><point><x>527</x><y>227</y></point><point><x>524</x><y>7</y></point><point><x>301</x><y>7</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Pingüino</tooltext><solvedtooltext>Los pingüinos, a diferencia de la mayoría de las aves, no pueden volar. Cuando andan tienen un aspecto muy divertido, como si estuvieran participando en una carrera de sacos. En cambio, son excelentes nadadores y pasan la mayor parte del tiempo en el agua.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B8265D4 </imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="3" seq="1" zindex="4" sequence="4"><image inbucketwidth="90" inbucketheight="80" onstagewidth="73" onstageheight="65" popwidth="108" popheight="96" onstagex="98" onstagey="19" baseheight="192" basewidth="216" pctstage="34.2" pctpop="50.1" pctbucket="41.7">T049934A.JPG</image><hotarea><point><x>16</x><y>7</y></point><point><x>18</x><y>220</y></point><point><x>207</x><y>220</y></point><point><x>276</x><y>13</y></point><point><x>16</x><y>7</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Ornitorrinco</tooltext><solvedtooltext>El ornitorrinco es un mamífero, aunque es un mamífero un poco raro, ya que pone huevos, como las aves. Además, el ornitorrinco tiene pico, aunque no tan duro como el pico de las aves.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>42D95D75</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="5" seq="1" zindex="5" sequence="5"><image inbucketwidth="103" inbucketheight="68" onstagewidth="93" onstageheight="62" popwidth="96" popheight="64" onstagex="172" onstagey="50" baseheight="128" basewidth="192" pctstage="48.5" pctpop="50" pctbucket="53.8">T054571A.JPG</image><hotarea><point><x>15</x><y>7</y></point><point><x>13</x><y>223</y></point><point><x>219</x><y>219</y></point><point><x>271</x><y>14</y></point><point><x>15</x><y>7</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Murciélago</tooltext><solvedtooltext>Los murciélagos son los únicos mamíferos que pueden volar. Otros mamíferos son capaces de planear.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B8284DA </imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="6" seq="1" zindex="6" sequence="6"><image inbucketwidth="90" inbucketheight="80" onstagewidth="85" onstageheight="76" popwidth="108" popheight="96" onstagex="160" onstagey="122" baseheight="192" basewidth="216" pctstage="39.8" pctpop="50.1" pctbucket="41.7">T054582A.JPG</image><hotarea><point><x>14</x><y>11</y></point><point><x>21</x><y>223</y></point><point><x>210</x><y>220</y></point><point><x>269</x><y>12</y></point><point><x>14</x><y>11</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Ballena jorobada</tooltext><solvedtooltext>Como otros mamíferos, las ballenas tienen pelo (aunque apenas lo puedes ver) y alimentan con leche a sus crías.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B8284E5 </imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="7" seq="1" zindex="7" sequence="7"><image inbucketwidth="90" inbucketheight="80" onstagewidth="77" onstageheight="68" popwidth="108" popheight="96" onstagex="310" onstagey="127" baseheight="192" basewidth="216" pctstage="35.7" pctpop="50" pctbucket="41.7">T058505A.JPG</image><hotarea><point><x>314</x><y>6</y></point><point><x>249</x><y>221</y></point><point><x>528</x><y>224</y></point><point><x>520</x><y>9</y></point><point><x>314</x><y>6</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Búho</tooltext><solvedtooltext>Los búhos, a diferencia de otras aves, son activos durante la noche. Sus grandes ojos les permiten ver en la oscuridad y encontrar a ratones, conejos e incluso murciélagos, de los que se alimentan.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B82FBE3 </imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="8" seq="1" zindex="8" sequence="8"><image inbucketwidth="90" inbucketheight="80" onstagewidth="72" onstageheight="64" popwidth="108" popheight="96" onstagex="315" onstagey="46" baseheight="192" basewidth="216" pctstage="33.7" pctpop="50" pctbucket="41.7">T058508A.JPG</image><hotarea><point><x>307</x><y>8</y></point><point><x>255</x><y>227</y></point><point><x>523</x><y>219</y></point><point><x>518</x><y>5</y></point><point><x>307</x><y>8</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Pato</tooltext><solvedtooltext>Los patos son aves acuáticas, amantes del agua. ¿Sabías que tienen plumas impermeables que les permiten mantener su cuerpo seco?</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B82FBE4 </imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="9" seq="1" zindex="9" sequence="9"><image inbucketwidth="53" inbucketheight="80" onstagewidth="57" onstageheight="86" popwidth="64" popheight="96" onstagex="98" onstagey="104" baseheight="192" basewidth="128" pctstage="44.8" pctpop="50" pctbucket="41.7">T628204A.JPG</image><hotarea><point><x>11</x><y>12</y></point><point><x>16</x><y>221</y></point><point><x>203</x><y>225</y></point><point><x>271</x><y>9</y></point><point><x>11</x><y>12</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Mono de noche</tooltext><solvedtooltext>Este mamífero recibe también el nombre de mono o mico lechuza. ¿Sabrías adivinar por qué?</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B82A534 </imagerefid><altitems/></item></items><bgimagerefid/><rewards><reward><text textstyleid="2">&lt;html&gt;¡Enhorabuena, excelente puntuación!&lt;/html&gt;</text><imagefile>Jungle1.swf</imagefile></reward><reward><text textstyleid="2">&lt;html&gt;Lo has hecho muy bien. ¿Quieres jugar de nuevo?&lt;/html&gt;</text><imagefile>Jungle2.swf</imagefile></reward><reward><text textstyleid="2">&lt;html&gt;Seguro que puedes hacerlo mejor. ¿Quieres intentarlo de nuevo?&lt;/html&gt;</text><imagefile>Jungle3.swf</imagefile></reward></rewards></standardslide></slide></slides><iaigame bucketdirection="horizontal" bucketposx="8" bucketposy="35" stagewidth="538" stageheight="230" bucketwidth="538" bucketheight="90"><resetbuttontext textbuttonstyleid="1">&lt;html&gt;Nuevo intento&lt;/html&gt;</resetbuttontext><scorelabeltext textstyleid="3">&lt;html&gt;Puntuación:&lt;/html&gt;</scorelabeltext><matcheslabeltext textstyleid="4">&lt;html&gt;aciertos&lt;/html&gt;</matcheslabeltext><trieslabeltext textstyleid="4">&lt;html&gt;intentos&lt;/html&gt;</trieslabeltext></iaigame><textstyles><textstyle size="16" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="2" align="left" id="1"/><textstyle size="20" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="2" align="center" id="2"/><textstyle size="16" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="1" underline="0" colorid="1" align="left" id="3"/><textstyle size="12" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="1" underline="0" colorid="1" align="left" id="4"/><textstyle size="13" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="3" align="center" id="5"/><textstyle size="13" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="4" align="center" id="6"/><textstyle size="20" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="0" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="5" align="left" id="7"/><textstyle size="11" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="0" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="5" align="left" id="8"/></textstyles><textbuttonstyles><textbuttonstyle showbg="0" showoutline="0" basestyleid="5" rollstyleid="5" downstyleid="5" selectedstyleid="5" disabledstyleid="6" basestateid="1" rollstateid="1" downstateid="1" selectedstateid="1" disabledstateid="2" id="1"/></textbuttonstyles><creditsdialogdata bodystyleid="8" titlestyleid="7"><dialogtitle>&lt;html&gt;Créditos&lt;/html&gt;</dialogtitle><text>&lt;html&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ardilla voladora&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Photo Researchers, Inc./Nick Bergkessel&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Águila calva&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Animals Animals/Ken Cole&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Pingüino&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bruce Coleman, Inc./John Shaw&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ornitorrinco&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Photo Researchers, Inc./Tom McHugh&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Murciélago&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Animals Animals/Stephen Dalton&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ballena jorobada&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Animals Animals/James D. Watt&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Búho&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bruce Coleman, Inc./Erwin and Peggy Bauer&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Pato&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Animals Animals/Ray Richardson&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mono de noche&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Peter Arnold, Inc./Luiz C. Marigo&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</text></creditsdialogdata><colors><color r="137" g="51" b="204" id="1"/><color r="50" g="50" b="50" id="2"/><color r="255" g="255" b="255" id="3"/><color r="228" g="194" b="255" id="4"/><color r="0" g="0" b="0" id="5"/></colors><twocolorbuttonstates><tcbuttonstate outlinecolorid="3" bgcolorid="3" graphiccolorid="3" id="1"/><tcbuttonstate outlinecolorid="3" bgcolorid="3" graphiccolorid="4" id="2"/></twocolorbuttonstates><twocolorbuttonstyles/></iai>